# Caseworker journeys

Journey stubs for TEC caseworker review work. Each board uses the same blockframe pattern as [Validate from Tasks](/tec-pcn-blockframes.html#journey-validate-from-tasks): Tasks → event → Case details. Frames reuse the TEC PCN primitives as placeholders until the screens are designed in detail.

Yellow outline (`highlight`) and link-blue (`callout`) mark the Next steps control that starts each journey. Hover blocks for element names.

## Journey: Review an out-of-time validation failure

Caseworker opens a case with an out-of-time validation failure, uses **Next steps** on an assigned task, completes the review event, then returns to Case details.

